{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"``` I wish to put my hat in the ring for Gil's position... I know that I haven't been one for politics before but... I have to do better for all of you and for Gil, I will do everything in my power to bring us together and strengthen Roanoke and the colony for the betterment of everyone. You are all going to see a new and improved Percival Pierce before you soon enough                           - Percival Pierce (Formerly Castor Pierce)```","created_at":"2020-08-13T09:08:49.879000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-13T09:09:50.080000Z","id":"743395630268940348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"A notice is left.\n```Following the successful experiment with raising the dead last night, the laws following raising the dead are now as follows. It is permitted, but only if all of the following conditions are met:\n1: A body may only be raised if consent was given from the deceased in life or if no opinion was specified and those close to the deceased consent.\n2: Any attempt to raise the dead should be performed only on those having no connection to the hags or their magic.\n3: Raising the dead shall not trap or resurrect the spirit, only the physical body.\n4: Raising the dead shall be done outside of the colony proper, but not on any other tribe's lands.\n5: At least two council members must be present for the raising of the dead, and the event must be open to any and all colony members.\nColonists are encouraged to make known in a will their position on raising their body from the dead to ensure the most amicable raising possible.\nBest regards,\n        -Web, truth seeker.```","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:50:02.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743602292611088436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
